<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Communications Systems.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Communications Systems.</headline>
<text>
<p>--Dain Bosworth analyst Tim Klasell said he had started coverage of Communications Systems Inc with a hold rating.</p>
<p>--Shares in the telecommunications and data equipment maker closed Thursday at 13-1/2 bid, 14 asked.</p>
<p>--&quot;We consider the stock fully valued but with little downside risk,&quot; Klasell said.</p>
<p>-- Chicago Newsdesk 312-408-8787</p>
</text>
